<title>USA: Gaylord closes station sale for $160 mln.</title>
<headline>Gaylord closes station sale for $160 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaylord Entertainment Co said Monday that it has completed the sale of its Seattle television station, KSTW-TV, for $160 million to the Paramount Stations Group Inc.</p>
<p>Gaylord is a diversified entertainment and communications company.</p>
</text>
